    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Part of the LV Ski collection, the Mia Pochette is a compact, elongated baguette silhouette crafted from a wool and cashmere blend. Its fluffy cream fleece evokes thick winter snow, while scattered tan Monogram motifs add a playful touch. A tan leather strap runs vertically down the center, punctuated by a refined S-Lock clasp as the focal point.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
