    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This season, the classic LV Alma shell bag debuts a new construction in soft Monogram canvas. Pintuck pleats at the sides lend the once-structured silhouette a more relaxed, nonchalant attitude. Offered in the medium size, the bag is accented with a gold-tone trunk charm and a tag printed with the brand's Paris headquarters, a nod to LV's trunk-making heritage and spirit of travel.",
