    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For Fall/Winter 2026, LOEWE introduces this Flamenco mini clutch in soft, lightweight nappa lambskin with a cloud-like shape. Its standout feature is the allover embroidery of plump beaded ring fringes in a vibrant bright green reminiscent of lush vines in nature, echoing the floral motif on the body. The long fringes sway with every step, creating a beautiful sense of drape and movement.",
